@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam participantBorderColor #2E4057
skinparam participantFontColor #2E4057
skinparam participantFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #2E4057
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #2E4057
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #F0F4F8

title "Diagrama de Secuencia - Flujo de Checkout"

' ============================================================
' ACTORES / PARTICIPANTES
' ============================================================
actor "Usuario" as User
participant "Frontend\n(React + Vite)" as Frontend
participant "Backend API\n(Django + DRF)" as Backend
participant "Base de Datos" as DB
participant "Wompi API" as Wompi
participant "Cloudinary" as Cloudinary

' ============================================================
' FLUJO PRINCIPAL
' ============================================================

== Agregar al Carrito ==

User -> Frontend: Selecciona producto,\ntalla y color
Frontend -> Backend: POST /api/cart/add/\n{product_id, variant_id, quantity}
Backend -> DB: Validar stock disponible
DB --> Backend: Stock confirmado
Backend -> DB: Crear/actualizar CartItem
DB --> Backend: CartItem creado
Backend --> Frontend: 201 Created\n{cart_id, items, total}
Frontend --> User: Carrito actualizado

== Iniciar Checkout ==

User -> Frontend: Proceder al pago
Frontend -> Backend: POST /api/checkout/init/\n{shipping_info, design_data}
Backend -> DB: Crear Order (status: pendiente)
DB --> Backend: Order creada
Backend -> DB: Crear OrderItems desde CartItems
DB --> Backend: OrderItems creados
Backend -> Backend: Calcular total de la orden

== Integración con Wompi ==

Backend -> Wompi: POST /v1/transactions/\n{amount, reference, currency, redirect_url}
note right
  Payload incluye:
  - monto total
  - referencia única (order_number)
  - URL de redirección
  - URL de webhook
end note
Wompi --> Backend: 201 Created\n{data: {id, redirect_url}}

Backend -> DB: Guardar payment_transaction_id\ny payment_reference
Backend --> Frontend: 200 OK\n{redirect_url, order_number}
Frontend --> User: Redirigiendo a pasarela...

== Pago en Wompi ==

User -> Wompi: Completa formulario de pago\n(tarjeta, PSE, etc.)
Wompi --> User: Confirmación de pago

== Notificación Webhook ==

Wompi -> Backend: POST /api/webhook/wompi/\n{transaction: {id, status, ...}}
note right
  Wompi envía webhook
  con el resultado de
  la transacción
end note
Backend -> Wompi: Validar firma del webhook
Backend -> DB: Actualizar Order.status\n(pagado / rechazado)
Backend -> DB: Guardar payment_wompi_status\ny payment_confirmed_at
Backend -> DB: Descontar stock de Variants
DB --> Backend: Confirmación

alt Pago exitoso
  Backend --> Frontend: (opcional) Evento WebSocket\norden confirmada
  Frontend --> User: Pedido confirmado\n¡Gracias por tu compra!
else Pago rechazado
  Backend --> Frontend: (opcional) Evento WebSocket\npago rechazado
  Frontend --> User: Error en el pago\nIntenta de nuevo
end

== Consultar Estado de Orden ==

User -> Frontend: Consultar estado del pedido
Frontend -> Backend: GET /api/orders/{order_number}/
Backend -> DB: Consultar Order + OrderItems
DB --> Backend: Datos de la orden
Backend --> Frontend: 200 OK\n{order, items, status, payment}
Frontend --> User: Detalle del pedido

@enduml
